  (text "ESC: up to 20 A motor current (THW-1060: 60 A cont.)\nfrom the battery on its own 12 AWG leads, OFF-BOARD.\nOnly its 3-wire receiver lead lands here (J3).\nJ5 (JST-XH 6-pin) to ESP32: 1 U1_PG (GPIO TBD),\n2 THROTTLE_PWM GPIO5, 3 STEER_PWM GPIO4,\n4 I2C_SDA GPIO8, 5 I2C_SCL GPIO9, 6 GND. 3.3 V logic." (at 104.14 116.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5c741e29-95c7-5b91-a06f-a6500e8600da))
